@meeting careerCaptain
// PLACEHOLDER (the career engineer, 0.61.0): head writer 4 writes the real one. The Captain's reprimand: your work
// standing is very low after the Chief's talk. An appointment in the ready room, Deck 1. Missed: the gist by Mail.
title: The Captain's ready room
from: Commander Teo Vance
gist: The Captain sent for you and you didn't come. Commander Vance says she has noted it.
== lines
marrow > you: Stand there, please. This isn't a social call.
marrow: Chief Calder spoke to you. Since then you've missed more shifts. Every one of them lands on someone else.
marrow: I don't send people home lightly. But I will, if this goes on.
? choice
* I understand, Captain.   rel:marrow+1
  marrow: I hope so. Show me, not Calder. The board will tell me.
* I'll put it right.   rel:marrow+1
  marrow: Then start tomorrow at eight.   [nod]
* (Say nothing)
  marrow: Very well. Dismissed.
